---
import '../styles/kit.css';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { href } from '../lib/site';

---

<Page path="/privacy">
	<main id="main" tabindex="-1">
	    <div class="bd first"><div class="wrap"><h1 class="t60">Privacy policy</h1></div><div class="wrap prose"><p>Last updated: 24 October 2026</p></div></div>
	    <div class="bd"><section class="wrap prose" aria-labelledby="p1" style="gap:var(--space-4)"><div class="sh"><h2 id="p1" class="t28">Privacy</h2></div>
	<p>This page covers this website. The a11ign software is separate: <span class="hl">it sends nothing anywhere</span>, and its licence covers how you use it.</p>
	    </section></div>
	    <div class="bd"><section class="wrap prose" aria-labelledby="p2" style="gap:var(--space-4)"><div class="sh"><h2 id="p2" class="t28">What we collect</h2></div>
	<ul><li>We don’t collect personal information through this website. There are no accounts, forms or advertising.</li><li>We count visits to see which pages people read. We use a tool that doesn’t use cookies and doesn’t identify you.</li><li>If you email us, we use your email address to reply.</li></ul>
	    </section></div>
	    <div class="bd"><section class="wrap prose" aria-labelledby="p3" style="gap:var(--space-4)"><div class="sh"><h2 id="p3" class="t28">Other sites</h2></div>
	<p>Our code and issues live on GitHub. What you share there is covered by GitHub&rsquo;s own privacy policy.</p>
	    </section></div>
	    <div class="bd"><section class="wrap prose" aria-labelledby="p3b" style="gap:var(--space-4)"><div class="sh"><h2 id="p3b" class="t28">Questions and complaints</h2></div>
	<p>Email hello@a11ign.com and we’ll reply. If you’re unhappy with how we handle your data, you can also contact the Information Commissioner&rsquo;s Office (ico.org.uk).</p>
	    </section></div>
	    <div class="bd"><section class="wrap prose" aria-labelledby="p4" style="gap:var(--space-4)"><div class="sh"><h2 id="p4" class="t28">Who runs this site</h2></div>
	<p>Daniel Beck, as a personal, non-commercial project.</p>
	    </section></div>
	    <div class="bd"><section class="wrap prose" aria-labelledby="p5" style="gap:var(--space-4)"><div class="sh"><h2 id="p5" class="t28">Changes</h2></div>
	<p>If we change this page, we’ll update the date above. If we add anything that tracks visitors, we’ll say so here first.</p>
	    </section></div>
	  </main>
</Page>

